      "mergedPostDetails": "Step to reproduce\n\n1. Open Settings app\n\n2. Go to Accessibility -> Motion\n\n3. Turn On “Limit Frame Rate”\n\n4. Open VRChat\n\n5. Open Settings in VRChat\n\n6. Open Graphics tab\n\n7. Set FPS Limit to 40\n\nExcepted Result\n\n FPS is capped at 40\n\nActual Result\n\n FPS is capped at 60\n\nSystem Information \n\nDevice: iPhone 16 Pro\n\nOS: iOS 18.0.1",
